  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&#x2019;s core voluntary contribution to UNAIDS 2024-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&apos;s cooperation with UNAIDS is based on the organisation strategy covering the period 2024-2029. 
The priority results defined for Denmark&apos;s interaction with UNAIDS are to: 
1) Ensure that UNAIDS&#x2019;s clear focus on advancing human rights, including women&#x2019;s and girls&#x2019; rights, including SRHR and gender equality, is maintained;
2) Ensure that young people, especially young women and adolescent girls, have access to prevention; and
3) Ensure a resilient and fit-for-purpose UNAIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
